# Gmail App Password — powers the contact form (/api/contact).
# 1. Turn on 2-Step Verification on the Gmail account: myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Go to myaccount.google.com/apppasswords and create an app password.
# 3. Copy it into .env.local (which is gitignored) as:
#    GMAIL_USER=oludeadeola67@gmail.com
#    GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
# Do not use your real Gmail login password here — it will not work, and
# should never be hardcoded into an app even if it did.
GMAIL_USER=
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=
